# Prevents GitHub Copilot from reading/sending these files as context.
# Critical for this repo since it handles PHI-adjacent medical imaging data —
# nothing here should ever be sent to Copilot's backend as context.

# Environment / secrets files
*.env
.env.*

# Any secrets directory, anywhere in the tree
**/secrets/**

# Sample/test DICOM files that may contain real or realistic PHI
**/test-data/*.dcm

# Anything with "phi" in the filename, anywhere in the tree
**/*phi*

# Belt-and-suspenders: also exclude common credential file patterns
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/credentials.json
**/*_rsa
